>. One wrong move and that perfect counterfeit bill is as good as toilet paper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce all sorts of fakes, sell them to your fence friends, and of course use your front front to launder your illicit gains. Just make sure you don't draw too much attention. City Hall inspectors are one thing, you can hide your forgery equipment, but an FBI raid can make a mess of your backside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078270/extras/e907bd7c0b2cffcd5096a38b152325b1.poster.avif?t=1760357254\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078270/extras/e907bd7c0b2cffcd5096a38b152325b1.webm?t=1760357254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078270/extras/e907bd7c0b2cffcd5096a38b152325b1.mp4?t=1760357254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Business in the Front</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as a laundromat owner, you have to deal with customers, set prices, supply the right washing machines and detergents, balance your costs, pay your bills. There's a lot to do while you grow your business and offer new services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078270/extras/fa50d5ca6bb01f3f042453fcf2a4e1cc.poster.avif?t=1760357254\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078270/extras/fa50d5ca6bb01f3f042453fcf2a4e1cc.webm?t=1760357254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared